WEBVTT

00:01.961 --> 00:05.089
<i>Under the seven stars shining in the sky,</i>

00:05.256 --> 00:10.218
<i>a dreadful assassination art
lay hidden for 1,800 long years</i>

00:10.219 --> 00:12.930
<i>in the darkness of history.</i>

00:17.309 --> 00:22.105
<i>Living in history's shadows,
concealed in history's darkness,</i>

00:22.106 --> 00:25.025
<i>it's an art that moved through the ages.</i>

00:25.526 --> 00:27.027
<i>And its name is...</i>

02:03.582 --> 02:07.418
SOUTHERN CROSS

02:07.419 --> 02:08.838
Let's keep moving.

02:09.004 --> 02:12.882
Those King guys aren't gonna
leave us alone for long.

02:12.883 --> 02:17.680
We gotta get out of their turf
as soon as we can.

02:20.766 --> 02:24.603
This is why I told you
not to get involved.

02:25.896 --> 02:26.772
Hm?

02:27.773 --> 02:28.983
What's that?

02:32.778 --> 02:34.320
Oh man.

02:34.321 --> 02:36.991
Poor bastard getting strung up
in a place like this.

02:37.199 --> 02:39.285
Wonder what he...

02:40.286 --> 02:42.079
W... What?!

02:42.204 --> 02:44.747
TO THE MAN WITH SEVEN SCARS
KEEP RUNNING AND PEOPLE DIE - KING

02:44.748 --> 02:48.961
Then that means...
they did this to send you a message?

02:49.920 --> 02:53.339
And if they wanted
to make sure we saw it,

02:53.340 --> 02:56.468
then I bet this guy's not the only one...

03:06.896 --> 03:09.690
Good heavens...

03:11.734 --> 03:13.152
C'mon now!

03:13.611 --> 03:16.655
You gotta put your back into it
if you wanna save your pops!

03:25.331 --> 03:31.295
And you! How's it feel to have your fate
resting on your daughter's shoulders?

03:34.131 --> 03:35.466
Papa...

03:36.717 --> 03:38.344
Please... Let me go...

03:39.136 --> 03:43.140
We haven't done anything to you!

03:43.265 --> 03:46.018
Why are you doing this?

03:46.518 --> 03:48.062
Why, you ask?

03:49.355 --> 03:51.899
I don't need a reason!

03:52.024 --> 03:54.860
You live and die at my whim!

04:07.456 --> 04:09.500
So, you finally show your ugly mug.

04:09.959 --> 04:11.626
It's you, isn't it?!

04:11.627 --> 04:15.005
The dumb bastard who dared to defy King!

04:18.175 --> 04:19.635
Hey, brute.

04:20.552 --> 04:23.639
I'm just passing through.

04:24.223 --> 04:26.517
I recommend that you don't interfere.

04:29.687 --> 04:33.774
I have orders from King
to eliminate you.

04:34.483 --> 04:36.402
You've got nowhere to run!

04:36.610 --> 04:41.698
You may have bested Spade,
but I, Diamond, am a cut above the rest!

04:41.699 --> 04:45.995
Let's see how you handle my staff!

04:51.875 --> 04:55.629
Looks like you know
a bit of martial arts yourself.

04:56.547 --> 05:00.467
Then try and keep up with this!

05:02.428 --> 05:05.764
You can't even see it coming, can you?

05:07.266 --> 05:10.227
Time to get wrecked!

05:16.400 --> 05:17.401
Ken...

05:19.278 --> 05:20.654
Die!

05:23.490 --> 05:26.493
You're so slow, it's putting me to sleep.

05:26.744 --> 05:28.704
W... What?!

05:34.293 --> 05:36.420
Show's over, clown.

05:36.670 --> 05:39.297
I... Impossible...

05:39.298 --> 05:42.051
He's holding me up with just one arm...

05:48.348 --> 05:50.684
Neck-Twisting Face-Splitting Fist!

05:53.353 --> 05:54.646
Was that...

05:56.023 --> 06:01.445
the Hokuto Shinken
everyone's talkin' about?

06:06.825 --> 06:08.243
Ken!

06:12.289 --> 06:17.169
Incredible! First you take down Spade,
and now Diamond!

06:19.254 --> 06:20.589
King...

06:26.386 --> 06:27.346
Hey.

06:27.596 --> 06:30.766
You sure you wanna pick a fight with King?

06:35.854 --> 06:36.814
Look.

06:37.189 --> 06:40.233
That's King's city, Southern Cross.

06:40.234 --> 06:41.860
Southern Cross?!

06:42.486 --> 06:45.030
Huh? What's wrong?

06:46.532 --> 06:48.867
No. It's nothing.

07:08.095 --> 07:09.179
Huh?

07:23.944 --> 07:26.654
Damn... You're a total badass.

07:26.655 --> 07:28.656
You really can do anything.

07:28.657 --> 07:31.118
Even your stealth skills are top-notch.

07:32.661 --> 07:34.997
Hokuto Shinken is an assassination art.

07:35.330 --> 07:38.500
It reaches its full potential
in the shadows.

07:38.792 --> 07:43.087
I see. So infiltration is like
second nature for you.

07:43.088 --> 07:49.178
Sneaking in undetected,
leaving just a corpse in your wake...

07:49.761 --> 07:51.305
You're a scary guy.

08:05.694 --> 08:08.155
Wait, what did you do?

08:08.363 --> 08:10.616
I hit a Channeling Point called Zusetsu.

08:11.408 --> 08:15.579
When he regains consciousness,
he won't remember any of this.

08:15.913 --> 08:18.332
Hmmm...

08:22.920 --> 08:24.962
Heh! Take that!

08:24.963 --> 08:26.173
Eek!

08:39.394 --> 08:40.938
Next!

08:41.104 --> 08:43.481
Hear that? Club is calling you!

08:43.482 --> 08:44.650
Go!

08:47.694 --> 08:50.572
What's wrong? Stand and face me.

08:50.906 --> 08:55.869
I told you, all you gotta do is
lay a single finger on me

08:56.245 --> 08:59.248
and I'll help you get outta here.

09:05.003 --> 09:09.132
Just like that!
Come at me like you mean it!

09:09.466 --> 09:13.427
I won't go down as easily
as Spade and Diamond.

09:13.428 --> 09:16.138
They always neglected their training,

09:16.139 --> 09:19.393
but I've never missed a day!

09:19.559 --> 09:21.728
I'm sure you can tell!

09:25.399 --> 09:27.526
I... I touched you!

09:28.235 --> 09:30.861
Oh? You scum.

09:30.862 --> 09:35.033
What makes you think livestock
like you deserves to touch me?

09:36.285 --> 09:37.827
But you promised...

09:37.828 --> 09:39.788
You said you'd help me if I...

09:44.167 --> 09:46.086
What the hell is he doing...?

09:46.211 --> 09:50.590
These assholes see the weak and powerless
as nothing but livestock!

09:50.799 --> 09:54.219
And even worse,
they're making a game outta killing them!

09:55.512 --> 09:57.139
H... Huh?

09:57.472 --> 09:59.474
Where are you going, Ken?

10:00.100 --> 10:02.894
Who's next?

10:04.271 --> 10:05.355
Huh?

10:05.564 --> 10:09.026
Stop wasting my time!
Hurry up and get over here!

10:17.159 --> 10:19.536
Who the hell are you?

10:22.622 --> 10:24.791
I have a question for you.

10:25.500 --> 10:31.131
Hey buddy.
You're not from around here, are you?

10:32.924 --> 10:36.927
If you were, you'd know
that you don't stand in front of me

10:36.928 --> 10:39.514
without pissing yourself in fear.

10:40.057 --> 10:43.142
Must be hard to act tough
when you look like a praying mantis.

10:43.143 --> 10:45.478
What the hell did you call me?

10:45.479 --> 10:47.856
I'll make hamburger outta you!

10:51.109 --> 10:52.152
What?!

11:00.327 --> 11:01.953
Five Finger Explosion!

11:09.086 --> 11:11.046
What's wrong, Mantis?

11:12.756 --> 11:14.132
Is that all you've got?

11:27.646 --> 11:28.730
What...

11:28.855 --> 11:30.649
What the hell did you do to me?!

11:31.483 --> 11:33.235
A secret technique of Hokuto Shinken.

11:33.485 --> 11:36.988
I struck one of your
Hidden Channeling Points, Meimon.

11:37.656 --> 11:40.033
Your life ends one minute from now.

11:40.450 --> 11:42.994
H... Hokuto Shinken?!

11:43.453 --> 11:44.871
Are you...?!

11:45.414 --> 11:48.582
Hey! What's happening to me?!

11:48.583 --> 11:51.377
My body is...!

11:51.378 --> 11:54.213
In one minute, the tension in your muscles

11:54.214 --> 11:57.634
will cause your spine to snap in two.

11:58.093 --> 11:59.844
What?!

11:59.845 --> 12:01.971
If you don't want to die,

12:01.972 --> 12:04.516
tell me what I want to know.

12:04.891 --> 12:08.102
Y... You got it!
Help me, and I'll tell you anything!

12:08.103 --> 12:09.688
That's the deal, right?

12:10.647 --> 12:15.527
You don't understand
the position you're in, do you?

12:16.111 --> 12:17.236
Look.

12:17.237 --> 12:19.280
You're running out of time.

12:19.281 --> 12:23.493
I understand! I'll tell you everything!

12:24.327 --> 12:27.038
Who is King?

12:27.289 --> 12:29.791
And where is he right now?

12:30.167 --> 12:33.961
King's in his stronghold!

12:33.962 --> 12:36.714
But nobody knows who he is!

12:36.715 --> 12:40.844
They say he uses a mysterious
and powerful martial art!

12:42.471 --> 12:43.680
A martial art...

12:44.473 --> 12:47.391
H... Hey... What are you waiting for?

12:47.392 --> 12:49.478
Hurry up and help me!

12:52.022 --> 12:54.899
What? Hey wait!

12:54.900 --> 12:57.486
This isn't what you promised!

12:58.612 --> 13:02.574
Have you ever kept a single promise
in your life?

13:03.074 --> 13:07.454
Have you even once spared someone
who was begging for mercy?

13:07.954 --> 13:11.583
I... Wait! Help me!

13:11.958 --> 13:14.419
I don't wanna die! I don't w--

13:17.797 --> 13:19.548
Amazing!

13:19.549 --> 13:22.052
You took down Club too!

13:23.261 --> 13:25.972
A city called Southern Cross...

13:26.306 --> 13:28.141
And a martial artist...

13:36.566 --> 13:38.318
Hokuto Shinken...

13:40.195 --> 13:41.863
So he still lives...

13:44.783 --> 13:46.575
Somebody took out Club!

13:46.576 --> 13:49.453
The Man with Seven Scars is in the city!

13:49.454 --> 13:50.871
Secure the perimeter!

13:50.872 --> 13:53.792
If anyone looks suspicous,
kill 'em on the spot!

13:56.127 --> 13:57.504
This way!

14:03.134 --> 14:05.136
Crap...

14:05.679 --> 14:08.640
What'll we do? They're on to us!

14:12.185 --> 14:13.727
What's wrong?

14:13.728 --> 14:16.064
You've been acting strange
for a while now.

14:17.232 --> 14:19.651
It's nothing.

14:19.859 --> 14:21.111
Hm?

14:22.070 --> 14:24.071
Ken! Look!

14:24.072 --> 14:25.698
It's about to start!

14:25.699 --> 14:27.701
They're bringing in new "livestock."

14:28.702 --> 14:29.786
Livestock?

14:36.376 --> 14:42.381
They kidnap people who are on the road
searching for nearby settlements,

14:42.382 --> 14:44.092
and bring them here.

14:44.593 --> 14:46.845
They call it "livestock hunting."

14:55.520 --> 14:58.481
Hurry up and get out!

14:59.524 --> 15:01.985
Stop cowering and move!

15:03.903 --> 15:06.114
We'll have a good view from here.

15:07.616 --> 15:09.825
Once someone is brought here,

15:09.826 --> 15:12.037
they don't make it out alive.

15:12.829 --> 15:13.871
Look!

15:13.872 --> 15:15.497
Just one look and you'll know.

15:15.498 --> 15:20.253
This Southern Cross place exists
for King and King alone.

15:30.639 --> 15:31.556
W...

15:32.432 --> 15:33.600
Wait!

15:39.064 --> 15:40.815
Stop! Please!

15:42.859 --> 15:47.237
You know what happens
to cattle on a ranch.

15:47.238 --> 15:49.407
We gotta brand ya!

15:55.455 --> 15:56.539
That's...

15:57.666 --> 15:59.709
The Bloody Cross!

16:02.796 --> 16:04.255
H... Hey!

16:04.422 --> 16:07.050
Ken, what's with you?

16:07.509 --> 16:08.593
It's him.

16:09.511 --> 16:14.223
Long ago, there was a martial artist
who used the Bloody Cross as his emblem.

16:14.224 --> 16:15.475
What?

16:15.600 --> 16:17.769
So you mean King...

16:18.561 --> 16:20.021
No doubt about it.

16:20.772 --> 16:23.650
A man like him would build
a city like this.

16:23.900 --> 16:26.276
Hey! You know who King is?!

16:26.277 --> 16:28.071
His name is Shin!

16:31.032 --> 16:32.533
He's the one

16:32.534 --> 16:35.245
who put these seven scars on my chest!

17:05.150 --> 17:07.819
You're as beautiful as ever.

17:16.411 --> 17:18.872
I got some interesting news today.

17:19.622 --> 17:21.583
Your beloved Kenshiro

17:21.916 --> 17:23.251
is still alive.

17:28.673 --> 17:30.049
Of course.

17:30.508 --> 17:32.635
You've already forgotten him, hm?

17:33.136 --> 17:35.096
A wise decision.

17:36.598 --> 17:39.017
After all, you'll never see him again.

17:39.392 --> 17:43.062
His martial arts are no match for Heart.

17:44.564 --> 17:45.856
Damn!

17:45.857 --> 17:48.526
Where the hell is he?

17:50.445 --> 17:52.070
Get me a drink! Now!

17:52.071 --> 17:53.363
Hurry it up, bartender!

17:53.364 --> 17:54.949
Right away!

17:58.161 --> 17:59.828
You little worm.

17:59.829 --> 18:01.331
Don't keep me waiting!

18:04.250 --> 18:06.044
That's enough.

18:06.836 --> 18:08.797
What was that?!

18:11.758 --> 18:14.010
Heart!

18:14.511 --> 18:18.430
Ah, look what you've done.

18:18.431 --> 18:21.975
You've got this poor man
trembling in his boots.

18:21.976 --> 18:24.354
How unbecoming.

18:27.273 --> 18:29.441
As you were.

18:29.442 --> 18:33.278
If they give you any more trouble,
just let me know.

18:33.279 --> 18:37.200
You workers are the backbone of our city.

18:37.450 --> 18:39.285
Yes, sir.

18:39.744 --> 18:42.956
I'll have a drink too,
while you're at it.

18:43.623 --> 18:44.707
Y... Yes, sir!

18:45.291 --> 18:46.417
Hm?

18:51.005 --> 18:53.883
B... Blood!

18:54.133 --> 18:56.343
My apologies.

18:56.344 --> 18:58.387
I'll clean it up right away.

18:58.388 --> 19:01.516
That hurts!

19:04.519 --> 19:07.856
It hurts! It hurts!

19:08.273 --> 19:10.440
There he goes again.

19:10.441 --> 19:12.150
This is bad!

19:12.151 --> 19:16.698
When Heart sees his own blood,
it sends him into a murderous rage!

19:16.990 --> 19:20.243
At this rate, he'll kill us too!

19:20.743 --> 19:22.494
Ready?

19:22.495 --> 19:24.413
Throw on my signal!

19:24.414 --> 19:26.790
We have to knock him out!

19:26.791 --> 19:29.711
It hurts! It hurts!

19:29.961 --> 19:31.296
Now!

19:36.050 --> 19:37.343
Did it work?

19:37.969 --> 19:39.012
Gah!

19:40.013 --> 19:43.725
He's pulling them in?!

19:56.696 --> 19:57.905
Imbeciles!

19:57.906 --> 20:03.411
Did you forget that my body is immune
to martial arts?

20:13.212 --> 20:14.672
Phew.

20:15.089 --> 20:17.675
I've gone and done it again.

20:18.134 --> 20:21.387
Even though I really hate blood.

20:39.906 --> 20:41.865
Talk about reckless.

20:41.866 --> 20:44.202
I can't believe
he's infiltrating King's stronghold.

20:50.208 --> 20:51.417
Hah...

20:53.086 --> 20:56.213
If that's how it is,
I gotta stick with him till the end!

20:56.214 --> 20:59.467
Besides, I might score some sweet loot!

21:23.825 --> 21:25.743
Not a soul in sight.

21:26.452 --> 21:28.079
Where is he?

21:44.387 --> 21:46.014
Kenshiro.

21:50.893 --> 21:52.687
Long time no see.

22:00.486 --> 22:01.696
Shin!

22:02.155 --> 22:04.282
I returned from the depths of hell

22:04.824 --> 22:08.870
to see you again!

23:37.041 --> 23:40.044
SUBTITLE TRANSLATION BY LEUCA HACHE
